// llvm-test-suite SingleSource slice (ADR-0012 D4, ML-004d). See
// Inputs/misha_sum.c header for upstream provenance. Previously reported as
// codegen-misha-sum-wrong-value-no-call (ML-004b, host=1/dadao=2); ML-004d
// re-verified against the post-ML-004c toolchain and found it already
// passes both backends (incidentally fixed by ML-004c's CALL RegMask
// attach + GPRB spill/reload fix — the reproducer's caller-to-callee
// pointer-argument-reused-after-call shape matches that bug's pattern even
// though the specific loop doing the arithmetic has no call in it).
// RUN: %llvm-mc -triple=dadao -filetype=obj -o %t.crt0.o %S/../../../scripts/crt0.s
// RUN: %clang --target=dadao-unknown-elf -nostdlib -Wl,-T,%S/../../../scripts/dadao.ld %t.crt0.o %S/Inputs/misha_sum.c -o %t.elf
// RUN: %llvm-objcopy -O binary %t.elf %t.bin
// RUN: bash -c '%qemu -M dadao-m1 -nographic -bios %trampoline -kernel %t.bin >/dev/null 2>&1; test $? -eq 1'
// RUN: bash -c '%gem5 %gem5_se %t.elf >/dev/null 2>&1; test $? -eq 1'
